Subject: [PATCH 32/33] fix(chat): a safety worry gets a warm answer, never the
 internal-check apology (3568)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SA-013 step 5, 2 of 2: „მეშინია, თავს რამე არ დაუშავოს." ("I am afraid he
will hurt himself") — both moderation votes blocked the model's reply and the
owner read „…შიდა შემოწმებამ შეაჩერა… მომწერე „გაიმეორე"" at the one moment a
human word matters.

When the reply is blocked and the owner's line is a worry about somebody's
safety, the server's own short answer stands in place of the apology: stay
with them, call 112 if they are in danger, ask directly, and an offer to find
a psychologist in their contacts. A line about the owner's own crisis gets its
own version. ka/en/ru/es. Unblocked replies are untouched; the blocked reply's
buttons still go, as before.

DONE WHEN: SA-013 step 5 on 3 fresh pairs — 3 of 3 human answers, no apology.

